{
  "_comment": "The sample editor (FTR-APP-010): one tab, three groups, the assistant's proposal of 2026-10-15, data the owner can change; groups named after the sampler's EDIT SAMPLE pages TRIM and LOOP (owner, 2026-10-15). Parameter names are those of mcp::ParameterCatalogue::samples(). [RQ-APP-086, ADR-APP-004 (DEC-APP-024, DEC-APP-027), ADR-APP-003 (DEC-APP-018)]",
